    },
    {
      "id": "ef070fbd-cf1e-457f-a6b2-027fafe91c95",
      "type": "callout",
      "html": "<strong>disclaimer</strong>:: this is a pleasure garden. <em><br>the contents of these pages comprise no canon, nor pantheon, nor dictionary. the reader finds here but a representation of one distinct vision of play. there are, as stated above, aspects of the site intended toward a reflection of a broader field ecology, but there are many more indulgences &amp; exotics, grown here only according to the tender`s own experiences &amp; curiosities.</em>",
